# Cloudflare Pages response headers (Sol security audit, 2026-10-04).
# Pages has no inline scripts; JSON-LD blocks are data, not script.
# cdn.jsdelivr.net serves Pretendard (stylesheet + woff2) to lang="ko" pages only; no script loads from it.
# Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy same-origin (2026-10-07): the site opens no window and is never opened as one that reports back
# (no window.open, no target="_blank", no postMessage, no OAuth window on this host), so no page needs an opener.
# HSTS deliberately has no includeSubDomains or preload: both bind every subdomain of one-by.one; see README.md.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

# Markdown twin of /connect/ for AI agents (linked via rel="alternate" type="text/markdown").
/connect/index.md
  Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
